(18807,'','Hello there, $c!$B$BWe cultivate and harvest the finest lotus flowers in all of Pandaria. From here they are sent down to the village of New Cifera where they are sorted and shipped all over the land.$B$BThe lotus has countless culinary, medicinal, and decorative applications - as you can imagine, demand is quite high.',0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
