(18900,'Greetings stranger. I am Silkmaster Tsai. Welcome to the ancient Imperial Silk Farm.$b$bThis farm dates back to some of the earliest dynasties of Pandaria, and each generation exceeds the last in quality of silk.','',0,1,2,1,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(18901,'Your clothing appears as one well travelled. Quite an interesting look. I might use it in one of my future clothing lines. I shall call it:$b$b$pique.','',0,1,2,1,0,0,0,0,'The boots, no. The belt, oh very much no. The shirt, stunning, but not on you. We should get you a real cape. And perhaps a vest with a proper hero\'s cut.','',0,1,274,1,0,0,0,0,'You remind me of a young Master Goh, minus the girth.$b$BHe first came to me a farm boy dressed in rags but with a stylish stride to him that owned the look.$B$bTogether we made a clothing line that was all the rage in the east for at least two years.','',0,1,0,11,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,1,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(18906,'Hey, sorry about that bottle, by the way. It\'s actually better to keep all the old slime in there - it ages like a fine brew.','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
