(19007,'Dezco is a great chieftan, though I\'m beginning to doubt how well we can survive in this land he led us to.','Dezco is a great chieftan, though I\'m beginning to doubt how well we can survive in this land he led us to.',0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a strange land. So beautiful. And yet so deadly.','This is a strange land. So beautiful. And yet so deadly.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I thought I saw eyes in the underbrush...','I thought I saw eyes in the underbrush...',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
