(19816,'Seeing scenery that beautiful really puts things into perspective.','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(19856,'Xuen teaches us that strength is a tool that requires practice.','',0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Every few days Xuen hosts a tournament of strength. Only the strongest and most brave challengers from across Pandaria dare compete.','',0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Watch out for Xuen\'s cubs. What they lack in size they make up for in pure strength.','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Legend has it that Xuen hasn\'t fought in one of his own tournaments in centuries.$b$bHe says it is because he wants us to have a fighting chance. I think he\'s just getting old. Or... at least... old for a... well... whatever he is.','',0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'You call those strong arms? Ha! I have bruises that have more muscle in them.','',0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Do you have the eye of a tiger?','',0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'First rule of the Tiger Temple Tournament: We don\'t talk about Tiger Temple Tournament.','',0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(19867,'My people, corrupted... Shai Hu, a local warrior, was the first to drink of the tainted waters. He was strengthed, emboldened, and urged the others to do the same. I warned them against it. I sensed danger, corruption...','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
