(19915,'As Waterspeaker, I performed many rituals. There is one, though, that I have never performed - to purify mental corruption. It is an ancient ritual, one which we have not needed since days of legend, when Shaohao walked Pandaria. I fear we need it now...','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(19938,'And now, we spring the trap on our attackers...','',0,1,396,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(19954,'Your presence here is unwelcome.','',0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a sacred place. Strangers are unwelcome.','',0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'What matter of \'thing\' are you?','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You smell of the low lands. You should go back to them. There is no peace in these mountains for travelers.','',0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'You will find no peace here.','',0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'You come as the carrion bird before a battle.','',0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(19964,'','For every ill or evil that rises in Pandaria, there is always a perfectly complementary cure. I find it to be a good analogy to all problems.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(19965,'Who would ever guess how much knowledge was hidden behind these walls. Between the wealth of information here and the lore you have uncovered in your travels, I believe I can weave together a few tales of our forgotten past.$b$bWhich one would you like to hear?','',0,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
