(21753,'Can you believe these people just set out free food? This place is amazing!','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Discovering the power in these shards gave me the will to drag myself out of the gutter and get my life together.$B$BOh, and also I was kicked out.','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Four months magic-free and it feels great.$B$BWho needs the infinite mystery of the arcane when you\'ve got fresh fruit and hot tea like this?','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These pandaren make some pretty good hooch, but none of them have heard of my favorite drink.$B$BMaybe I\'ll teach it to them some time...','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'-sniff- Woo! The old robe\'s getting a bit ripe.$B$BMaybe I can sneak a bath in that pond tonight...','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
