(22069,'Ah. The smell of a proper battlefield. We have been on our own for far too long. Now, the full might of the Horde is unleashed! And we are the ones who direct where the next blow will land.','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(22076,'I love overnight trips. Camping is my favorite thing!','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m a good dancer. Wanna see?','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t know why people treat me like a little kid!','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stop bothering me! I normally get up late in the afternoon.','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I want to be a singer when I grow up!','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A ha a ha a ha uh- uh! A ha a ha yeah yeah yeah yeah!$B$BDo you like my song?','',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'0',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),
